msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Muokkaa valikon rakennetta JSON-muodossa. Jokaisella kohteella voi olla: "
"name, icon, command (suoritetaan komentotulkin kautta) tai action "
"(istuntotoiminto: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, "
"reboot, shutdown), submenu (kohteiden taulukko) tai separator (true)."

